Better User Interface — for Dark Souls: Remastered 1.03.1

This pack merges two other Dark Souls: Remastered UI mods and adds hand edits:

  * Silver UI + Lock-on + Bow Aim + Translucent  (Nexus mod 39)
  * UI Icon Remake                               (Nexus mod 667)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Artwork — belongs to the original authors
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Every texture under "Texture Override/" is derived from those two packs and
stays the property of its original authors. This repository claims no
copyright over them and grants no commercial licence:

  * personal, single-player use with Dark Souls: Remastered (via DSR-TPUP)
    is what this pack is for;
  * do not sell it, do not ship it inside a paid product, do not re-upload it
    as your own work;
  * if an original author asks for their assets to be taken out of this pack,
    they will be removed.

